# Normalize line endings.
#
# This repo lints with eslint + prettier, which require LF. Without this file a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true materializes the tree as CRLF, and
# `npm run lint` (--max-warnings 0) then fails with a "Delete `␍`" error on every
# line of every touched file. Because `lint` runs inside `prepublishOnly`, that
# failure aborts `npm publish` on Windows even though the committed blobs are
# already LF.
#
# Text files are stored LF in the index and checked out LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
